// The floor is one big quad spanning the whole maze footprint, sitting at
// the bottom of the wall cubes' vertical extent (there's no separate
// floor/ceiling model -- see the README's rough edges).

// Half the maze's extent along one axis, in world units: `cells` grid cells of
// `spacing` each, centred on the origin.
floor_half(int cells) {
  int half_extent = (cells * (import spacing)) / 2;
} return int half_extent;
